WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Route a defined set, overflow rule, or caseload. Catena runs your pre-lit records and follow-through.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
When returns arrive, Catena checks every page and date range—catching missing CPT billing ledgers immediately.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Instead of handing gaps back to your paralegal, Catena chases the provider and verifies the corrected itemized bill.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
If later notes reveal new treatment like an MRI referral, Catena preserves earlier evidence and reopens readiness.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Only reserved legal decisions—such as treatment cutoff choices—route to your designated reviewer with linked evidence.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Catena prepares the verified chronology, specials, and demand package for your review. Your firm retains final authority.
